---
import LabLayout from '../../../components/LabLayout.astro';
---
<LabLayout
  title="Cohort retention analysis (concept)"
  description="Customer retention for a fictional meal-kit subscription: monthly cohort heatmap, retention curves, revenue retention and lifetime value. Concept analysis on generated sample data."
  crumb="Cohort analysis"
  path="/lab/cohorts/"
>
  <section class="lab-head">
    <p class="lab mono">[ Lab 04 ] Analysis · Cohorts · Retention</p>
    <h1>Greenbox meals<br /><em>who stays, who leaves</em></h1>
    <p>A fictional meal-kit subscription with eighteen months of customers. Each row is the group that signed up in one month; each column is how many of them were still paying a month later, two months later, and so on. This is the analysis behind most subscription and repeat-purchase decisions.</p>
    <div class="lab-meta mono" id="coMeta"></div>
  </section>

  <div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Options">
    <div><span class="flab mono">Measure</span>
      <span class="seg" id="fMetric">
        <button type="button" data-v="users" aria-pressed="true">Customers</button>
        <button type="button" data-v="rev" aria-pressed="false">Revenue</button>
      </span>
    </div>
    <div><span class="flab mono">Signed up via</span>
      <span class="seg" id="fSrc">
        <button type="button" data-v="" aria-pressed="true">All</button>
        <button type="button" data-v="discount" aria-pressed="false">50% first box</button>
        <button type="button" data-v="organic" aria-pressed="false">Full price</button>
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="kpis" id="coKpis"></div>

  <section class="panel" style="margin-top:1rem">
    <div class="panel__h"><h2>Retention by signup month</h2><span class="mono">Hover a cell</span></div>
    <div class="tbl-wrap"><div id="heat" class="coh"></div></div>
  </section>

  <div class="grid-b">
    <section class="panel">
      <div class="panel__h"><h2>Retention curves</h2><div class="legend" id="lgCurve"></div></div>
      <div class="chart" id="curve"></div>
    </section>
    <section class="panel">
      <div class="panel__h"><h2>Findings</h2><span class="mono">Computed from the table</span></div>
      <div class="insights" id="coIns"></div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <style is:global>
    .coh { display: grid; gap: 2px; min-width: 760px; font-family: var(--font-m); font-size: 0.68rem; }
    .coh__r { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 74px 58px repeat(13, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 2px; }
    .coh__h { color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; padding: 0.3rem 0.2rem; text-align: center; }
    .coh__h:first-child, .coh__l { text-align: left; }
    .coh__l { color: var(--fg-2); padding: 0.45rem 0.2rem; }
    .coh__n { color: var(--muted); padding: 0.45rem 0.2rem; text-align: right; }
    .coh__c { border-radius: 3px; padding: 0.45rem 0.2rem; text-align: center; color: var(--fg); position: relative; transition: transform 0.15s, outline-color 0.15s; outline: 1px solid transparent; }
    .coh__c:hover { outline-color: var(--fg); transform: scale(1.06); z-index: 2; }
    .coh__c.dark { color: var(--on-acc); }
  </style>

  <script>
    import { initCohorts } from '../../../scripts/lab/cohorts.js';
    initCohorts();
  </script>
</LabLayout>
